      "en": "As a servant who earnestly desires the shadow, as a hireling who looks for his wages,",
      "ko": "종은 저물기를 심히 기다리고 품군은 그 삯을 바라나니",
      "source_text_hash": "9f030113eca25f9b98be8391f86fa4a158e55a1c2f354b4c320d303ddbcdcf72",
      "translation_text_hash": "81951664786e821508401fb0f515e09bedefd0185a3d83da28083853aade7829",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "종은 저물기를 심히 기다리고 품군은 그 삯을 바라나니"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "81951664786e821508401fb0f515e09bedefd0185a3d83da28083853aade7829"
      ]
    },
