      "en": "My flesh is clothed with worms and clods of dust. My skin closes up, and breaks out afresh.",
      "ko": "내 살에는 구더기와 흙 조각이 의복처럼 입혔고 내 가죽은 합창되었다가 터지는구나",
      "source_text_hash": "19c4205ceb9d07ea4c473ef750b6bb08bad70aeaf583d3de843252d91a9e5bf8",
      "translation_text_hash": "cec4a35e79422adc83f51c50ec8143161220b0aab9328bc40b6b0c6486abbfb9",
