      "en": "My days are swifter than a weaver’s shuttle, and are spent without hope.",
      "ko": "나의 날은 베틀의 북보다 빠르니 소망 없이 보내는구나",
      "source_text_hash": "d7ae3548d2cbf8106fd57ec6dfac49e493b2a0a9cc316689116f10713a0b9979",
      "translation_text_hash": "644d01e319e4cd0d02ff44aaa2562c3d49ebf24c40406622b284b5d9a39d5669",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
